    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/46b2e3b5f4e95a9b6b7df0841da942e5.avif?t=1754784960\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TimeLost is a Team-Based PvP Arena Fighter. Master precision combat, customize your playstyle through dual-weapon builds, and climb the ranks in Arenas that transcend space and time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena equipped with two distinct weapons, each offering unique skills. Your selections not only define your combat style but also impact your health and dodge capabilities. Strategize and customize to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master The Art of Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend with precision by balancing blocks and dodges. Absorb damage with well-timed blocks, but depleting your stamina leaves you exposed. Evade strikes and debuffs with perfectly timed dodges, gaining brief invulnerability. Strategy and reflexes are the keys to dominating the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Combat with Endless Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast-paced battles where strategy and precision are key. Compete in ranked arenas, skirmishes, or control points\u2014each match brings new challenges. Customize builds to heal allies, debilitate enemies with status effects, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit the Black Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Black Market is the in-game shop where you can purchase new Weapons, Stimulants, Upgrade Chips, and other visual aesthetics to customize your character and weapons. You can acquire currency from competing in matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS!</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/aabc083a13bd6e4ba69ed73937602328.avif?t=1754784960\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/46b2e3b5f4e95a9b6b7df0841da942e5.avif?t=1754784960\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TimeLost is a Team-Based PvP Arena Fighter. Master precision combat, customize your playstyle through dual-weapon builds, and climb the ranks in Arenas that transcend space and time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena equipped with two distinct weapons, each offering unique skills. Your selections not only define your combat style but also impact your health and dodge capabilities. Strategize and customize to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/9618aefc3ea14af5df7032cecfe165df.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master The Art of Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend with precision by balancing blocks and dodges. Absorb damage with well-timed blocks, but depleting your stamina leaves you exposed. Evade strikes and debuffs with perfectly timed dodges, gaining brief invulnerability. Strategy and reflexes are the keys to dominating the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/91fe6212c70699dfe051802a993d529a.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Combat with Endless Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast-paced battles where strategy and precision are key. Compete in ranked arenas, skirmishes, or control points\u2014each match brings new challenges. Customize builds to heal allies, debilitate enemies with status effects, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.poster.avif?t=1754784960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.webm?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/641bacf0349f17a4d8a8bc2023ee2b02.mp4?t=1754784960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit the Black Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Black Market is the in-game shop where you can purchase new Weapons, Stimulants, Upgrade Chips, and other visual aesthetics to customize your character and weapons. You can acquire currency from competing in matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS!</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121320/extras/aabc083a13bd6e4ba69ed73937602328.avif?t=1754784960\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
